  - Non-goal conflict. "Event-driven architecture design" is a non-goal, but Cloud Run is for "event-driven services".
  - Cost. Apigee, Istio on every workload, DLP and Falco conflict with "optimize for cost" and a 5-engineer, 4-week MVP.

