  - Compute (clusters) is split by environment, for stability and access control.
  - Data is organized around the customer, with one controlled place where environments meet.

  Recommended design: three data zones

                   ┌──────────── PROD ZONE (prod perimeter) ────────────┐
                   │  acme-prod schema / rows / prefix                  │
                   │       │                                            │
                   │       ▼  publish job (named publisher identity)    │
                   │   sanitize + verify INSIDE prod                    │
                   └───────┬────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                           │  one-way, sanitized only
                           ▼
          ┌──────── EXCHANGE ZONE (per-customer slices) ────────┐
          │  acme/shared-reference   (catalogs, configs, flags) │ ◄── all 4 envs READ
          │  acme/from-prod          (sanitized / anonymized)   │ ◄── dev/stage/uat READ
          └───────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                  ▼
       ┌──────── NON-PROD ZONE (non-prod perimeter) ─────────┐
       │  acme-dev  │  acme-stage  │  acme-uat    (schemas)  │
       │  same instance → GRANTs work between them           │
       └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  ┌─────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────┐
  │                Zone                 │                                     Holds                                     │              Who reads              │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Prod zone                           │ Live prod data                                                                │ Prod only                           │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Exchange zone (new data-exchange    │ Each customer's shared reference data, plus sanitized and anonymized data     │ That customer's environments only   │
  │ project)                            │ published from prod                                                           │                                     │
  ├─────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────┤
  │ Non-prod zone                       │ Dev, stage and UAT data, as schemas on the same instance                      │ That customer's dev/stage/uat, per  │
  │                                     │                                                                               │ policy                              │
  └─────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────┘

